; Test journal for the e2e suite. Tests add to and edit a scratch copy of
; this file, so it is safe to modify.
;
; The last transaction deliberately carries html/javascript payloads in a
; description, an account name and a comment. security.spec.js asserts that
; every view renders them as text. Please keep them here.

; Declared commodities give the commodity filter row something to list;
; more than six, so it collapses to its selection, and webui.spec.js
; tests opening it, its memory, and its shift-click multi-select.
commodity $1000.00
commodity 1000.00 USD
commodity 1000.00 AAA
commodity 1000.00 BBB
commodity 1000.00 CCC
commodity 1000.00 DDD
commodity 1000.00 EEE

